WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.300
Good hospitality starts before the guest arrives. FormBridge gives your restaurant one

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:09.450
place to look after every enquiry.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:16.469
Let guests ask questions and share their plans through your own restaurant

00:00:16.469 --> 00:00:17.000
assistant.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:22.879
Requests arrive in a private team inbox, with the conversation and booking

00:00:22.879 --> 00:00:23.750
details together.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:29.367
Spot the birthday, the quiet table and the dietary request. Check the

00:00:29.367 --> 00:00:31.850
guest's words before keeping each detail.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:37.133
Give the enquiry an owner, a reminder and a useful handoff. Keep

00:00:37.133 --> 00:00:39.450
the next shift in the picture.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:44.975
Share a private review link. When plans change, the request comes back

00:00:44.975 --> 00:00:46.600
for another staff review.

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:53.250
Test channel messages and reservation handoffs with clearly labelled simulations. No real

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:55.750
messages or reservations are sent.

00:00:56.400 --> 00:01:03.525
FormBridge. Clear details, thoughtful service. Bring your own restaurant enquiry and make

00:01:03.525 --> 00:01:05.900
the next step easier.
